{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11107040","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11107040","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1110704001:1":{"text":"回来啦回来啦！我跟索恩出去这么久，大家肚子饿不饿？真令人担心！","source_cn":"回来啦回来啦！我跟索恩出去这么久，大家肚子饿不饿？真令...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D97FC3268636377","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110704002:1":{"text":"我看是你饿了吧。","source_cn":"我看是你饿了吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AB07B499C2D07EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110704003:1":{"text":"阿尔萨，索恩！你们回来了！","source_cn":"阿尔萨，索恩！你们回来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFA1DB677365D07D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110704004:1":{"text":"我们都听说啦！通过了所有试炼和考验的乌尔氏族勇士！","source_cn":"我们都听说啦！通过了所有试炼和考验的乌尔氏族勇士！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F492830ACA2B39B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110704005:1":{"text":"居然真的是我们的索恩和阿尔萨！还以为是叫同样名字的别人呢！","source_cn":"居然真的是我们的索恩和阿尔萨！还以为是叫同样名字的别人呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E53AC9133E4CF8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"